# ---- one EXISTS as a semi join, an anti join and a mark: the memo and the order ----

# E is a NIGHT trip of the rider (113 of the 240 riders), p a gold rider (80) and q a rider of city 1 (77, NULL for the
# 8 riders without a city). Each record counts the riders it keeps and sums their rows.

# E OR E and (E AND p) OR (E AND q): OR factoring makes E a top-level conjunct, a semi join, and binds the dropped OR
# only for its errors, so neither is a mark. DuckDB: (113, 13449); (74, 8734).
